  "description": "Email enquires only   \n\nThree / four bedroom semi-detached property located in the very popular Roscam area with impressive, modern finishes and high B energy rating. \n\nNumber 278 Boireann Bheag is a high quality and spacious property which is beautifully presented to the market ready for immediate use.  \n\nBuilt in 2007 by O’Malley Construction, the property was significantly upgraded featuring a large rear extension with a vaulted ceiling over a bright, spacious living area.   The kitchen was extended and comprises a generous breakfast bar with granite worktop and excellent storage. \n\nThere is also a separate bedroom/ office/ sitting room with bay window, utility and guest WC on the ground floor.  On the first floor there are three bedrooms with en-suite to the main bedroom and bathroom. The two front bedrooms have nice views towards the bay while the property also benefits from a private rear garden with a block built shed. \n\nBoireann Bheag is a hugely popular development just 6km from Galway City and is beautifully maintained with local shops and services nearby. Bus routes are available with easy access to both the M6 & M18 Motorways.",
